<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The four-day Supersport</p>
<p>Series match between Transvaal and Western Province ended in a</p>
<p>draw on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Transvaal 371 and 263-8 declared. Western Province</p>
<p>227 and 352-7 (H.Gibbs 103, H.Ackerman 122, E.Simons 58 not</p>
<p>out).</p>
</text>
